china_race_dynamics.text:
America must lead in the AI Race.
 
@POTUS and The White House are putting forward a strong plan to keep AI in American hands and on American terms. We cannot afford to fall behind to foreign adversaries like China. This direction will support American builders, create good paying jobs, and put some real guardrails in place to protect our kids, communities, and freedoms.
 
In Congress, I’ll fight to ensure America dominates the AI race and that the future of this technology is built here at home, not handed to China.
